  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_c97adc88-c4df-4f70-8715-ec3523f496cf.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\"> </strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Create Propulsion：模擬</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JHcArsDhh4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"192\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Propulsion-Team/create-propulsion-simulated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.3.1/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_35635d47-00d4-48c0-9758-f7374d6c60e1.png\" alt=\"oimars 設計的渦輪螺旋槳飛機\" width=\"824\" height=\"451\"></p>\n<p><strong>Create Propulsion：模擬</strong> 是一款適用於 Minecraft 1.21.1 的 NeoForge 模組，將以推進為核心的 Create 玩法引入 Sable 與 Create Aeronautics 生態系統中。</p>\n<p>它新增了三種推進器類型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推進器：標準燃料驅動推進</li>\n<li>離子推進器：由 FE（能量）驅動的推進</li>\n<li>創造模式推進器：可自訂的高功率推進器，用於測試與創造模式建築</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_8a595293-7cd5-49e8-9d5f-a8ac0914ef16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組直接整合了 Sable 與 Create Aeronautics 的機械組裝物理系統，包含力點行為以確保正確的扭矩，以及多推進器在組裝載具上的處理。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1522736/description_584f5630-6017-4404-a24a-3944f5fdb83e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此外還包含複製貓翅膀（Copycat Wings），提供輕量化空氣動力學建造，並支援複製貓風格的外觀自訂。</p>\n<br><strong>推進器支援以下模組提供的燃料：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: The Factory Must Grow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Crafts &amp; Additions</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Diesel Generators</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism: Generators</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/northstar-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Northstar: Redux</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellaris</a>\n<p><strong>特別感謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PacificCyan</strong> - 離子推進器模型、珊瑚發電機模型</li>\n<li><strong>FoxyFox909</strong> - 多區塊推進器</li>\n<li><strong>DeltaSF</strong> - 1.20.1 原版 Create: Propulsion 的創作者</li>\n<li><strong>Fleugle</strong> - 重新設計推進器模型／紋理</li>\n</ul>",
